Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 00:39:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02972/11362] [outer-loop] fix .414 solve-task precondition:
 bad pytest target blocked A4/A5/A6

Root cause of the 'No file changes produced' failures on A4/A5(+A6): my .414 NOCOV precondition
ran '.venv/bin/pytest tests/python/test_arc_solver_kit.py -q --no-cov', but that file does NOT
exist -> pytest exits 5 (0 tests collected) -> the codex agent correctly treats exit!=0 as a
blocked precondition (complete_blocked_kit_import) and produces nothing. A4 3-fail-skipped and A5
was failing the same way. Replaced the precondition with a real import smoke that exits 0:
'.venv/bin/python -c "from carnot.agentic import arc_solver_kit as k; k.offline_arcade()"'
(verified exit 0). Patched in the ACTIVE roadmap (research-roadmap.yaml; the -next file was consumed
at activation). A5 (re86) + A6 (bp35) can now run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
